  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Copper Seal mountain stands red and squarish in Mini Southern Border, with no soil at all, formed entirely from copper. Ascending dragon copper is named among its immortal copper, alongside profound gray copper, while mortal level copper such as chaotic sky copper, pragna copper, and snow flower copper fill most of the mountain. Immortal copper occupies only a small portion and is mostly rank six material. The mountain’s unique rank seven copper is domination copper.",
      "chapters": [
        1615
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "copper-seal-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a myriad tribulation, Copper Seal Mountain is half destroyed and molten. The text again names ascending dragon copper among the immortal copper that once made up the mountain, with profound grey copper beside it. Domination copper production on that mountain is lost after the strike.",
